    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a labyrinthic jail for mythical creatures, Luna is a succubus who has to find a way to escape from this place without losing her mind. <br> <br>Meet various colorful NPCs in this place, and find out the secrets that this wicked place keeps hidden in its most dark and forgotten depths.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587590/extras/88ddd85d0f5eb412cdf494dfb539b87a.poster.avif?t=1747218067\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587590/extras/88ddd85d0f5eb412cdf494dfb539b87a.webm?t=1747218067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Escape stealthily from the monsters that guard this place or use your seductive succubus powers to make your way through the dungeon. <br>Your behaviour will decide which endings you get: depending on how much you have abused your succubus powers, the Minotaur who guards this place will judge you differently, and decide if you're worthy of leaving or not.<br><br>The jail is also is full of puzzles to solve and mysterious npcs who will either help you in your journey or make it end prematurely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, In the jail you will find other prisoners who have been trapped by the minotaur; help them and they will show their appreciation in a variety of sexy ways, or kill them if you want to grow in power even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587590/extras/199800e7ba9742f2f05d1